    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Colours",
     "texto": [
      "Colours end in **색** («colour») and go **in front of** the noun, with nothing in between: **파란색 티셔츠** (blue T-shirt), **검은색 바지** (black trousers)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
